    ["<Assistant_Title1>【人脉好感-等级奖励】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>奖励获取说明：</>各位非凡者与人脉提升好感度等级时，可以领取对应人脉的好感度等级奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>具体奖励说明：</>随着人脉的好感度等级提示，各位非凡者除了可以获得记忆珍匣货币以外，还可以获取对应<Assistant_Property1>人脉的角色卡<>、<Assistant_Property1>人脉专属城堡挂画<>、<Assistant_Property1>社交动作<>、<Assistant_Property1>人脉同款发型<>、<Assistant_Property1>人脉专属称号<>。\n<Assistant_Title2>记忆珍匣说明：</>各位非凡者获得记忆珍匣后，可以在往事陈列馆购买特殊外装以及序列晋升需要的主材料。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Connection Favorability - Level Rewards】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Reward Acquisition Instructions: </>Every Beyonder can claim corresponding favorability level rewards when increasing their favorability level with a connection. \n<Assistant_Title2>Specific Reward Description: </>As the connection's favorability level increases, in addition to obtaining Memory Box currency, Beyonders can also obtain the corresponding <Assistant_Property1>Connection Character Card<><Assistant_Property1>, Connection Exclusive Castle Hanging Painting<><Assistant_Property1>, Social Action<><Assistant_Property1>, Connection Matching Hairstyle<><Assistant_Property1>, and Connection Exclusive Title<>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Memory Box Description: </>After obtaining a Memory Box, Beyonders can purchase special outfits and main materials needed for Sequence advancement in the Past Exhibition Hall.",
