    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\">开牌</>每隔45秒获得<HighLight>灵性预警</>，可以解除一次控制效果，触发后自身在2秒内移动速度增加25%。"] = "Every 45 seconds, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86030010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Reveal Card</> grants <HighLight>Spirituality Warning</>, which can remove one control effect. After triggering, your movement speed increases by 25% for 2 seconds.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86050050\" color=\"#f4a067\">足迹再现</>现在会向目标突进一小段距离。消耗<HighLight>3</>层<HighLight>足迹</>时，还会为目标附加<HighLight>1</>层<HighLight>层叠印记</>，最多叠加<HighLight>2</>层。\n\n<FaintYellow>层叠印记</>：\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86053010\" color=\"#f4a067\">层叠之门</>会引爆目标身上的全部<HighLight>层叠印记</>，每层使本次伤害提高<HighLight>60%</>。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86050050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Footprint Reappearance</> now dashes a short distance towards the target. Consuming <HighLight>3</> stacks of <HighLight>Footprints</> also applies <HighLight>1</> layer of <HighLight>Stacked Mark</> to the target, stacking up to <HighLight>2</> layers. \n\n<FaintYellow>Stacked Mark</>: \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86053010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Layered Gate</> detonates all <HighLight>Stacked Mark</> on the target, with each layer increasing this damage by <HighLight>60%</>.",
